(key: "hunter/tandem-executioner/tandem-executioner-techniques/vigilant-partners", blueprint: "4d64964f84a54a93864dc03821756226", name: "Vigilant Partners", summary: "Once a round, a hit on one of the pair can be negated by the other's Lore (Nature) or Mobility check against the attack roll.", guide: "hunter#vigilant-partners")
